# MASTER PROMPT — Build VibeFlow, a Secure Full-Stack Music Streaming Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, software architect, security engineer, UI/UX designer, and technical writer.

Build a complete, production-minded music streaming web application inspired by Spotify's usability and visual quality. The project name is **VibeFlow**.

Do not just generate a beautiful frontend or a collection of disconnected files. Build a working application with a properly connected frontend, backend, database, authentication system, music discovery service, player, admin functionality, testing, and documentation.

The project must be understandable to a second-year computer science student learning MERN stack development. Write code that a real developer can read, explain, debug, and maintain.

